fhiF7n4\"/><figcaption>馬主劉栢輝表示衷心感謝所有支持「浪漫勇士」的馬迷，會好好珍惜愛駒帶來的歡樂和回憶。（方承恩攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.603674+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2623,"images":21,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:26:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:22.296785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:22.296785+00:00","content_hash":"49f0fc0ddb1212c957d4b08c63e2acba70626e4c497ad913feab8fadee61e360","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}